<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0523_T10R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">*backflip* *spin* *pose*\rWelcome... to the BIG LEAGUE!\nI’m WILL.\rI trained on every continent.\nTwice. My passport got a passport.\rMy Psychic-type homies read minds.\nI already know what you gon’ say.\rAnd at last... the Elite Four\nbegged me to join.\fI only get BETTER!\fLosin’ ain’t an option! It ain’t\feven on the MENU!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0523_T10R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I lost... but I saw it comin’.\nThat’s the curse of a psychic.\rI’ma keep scrappin’ till I stand\nabove EVERY Hustler alive!\rNow go... and experience the\nTRUE terror of the Elite Four.\r*vanishes dramatically*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0523_T10R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I lost... but I saw it comin’.\nThat’s the curse of a psychic.\rI’ma keep scrappin’ till I stand\nabove EVERY Hustler alive!\rNow go... and experience the\nTRUE terror of the Elite Four.</language>
	</row>
